  "description": "Mediatly is a lightweight, MIT-licensed, single-file CQRS mediator for .NET. It provides a simple, dependency-free implementation with a familiar API, making it easy to integrate into existing CQRS applications. Commands, queries, notifications, and pipeline behaviors with reflection-free / Native AOT registration options. Zero dependencies beyond Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions.",
  "id": "Mediatly",
